  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 34e3dacc4599bc547af4a43b0b848c66, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Note: "Manages incoming eyetracking data, conversion and forwarding to dataclients.\nAlso
    checks valid eye gaze package against the `GazeCollision` layer for raycast hits.\n\n>
    EyeDataClients register to this handlerneed to reference this EyeDataHandller
    on their inspector settings.\n> EyeDataClients need to implement the EyeDataClient
    interface. \n> Tick \"Process on Start\" on the EyeDataHandler if you want to
    push data to the clients right from the start. Otherwise you need to call the
    according method from code to start pushing. \n\n"
